# Build artifacts and evidence for the /play three-character cliffside trio.
# ~1 GB of Godot projects, import caches and web exports. All of it is
# REPRODUCIBLE from the tracked scripts in this directory plus the frozen
# exporter, and the shipped result lives in reincarnated-loadout. Tracked here:
# the scripts only.
#
#   build_char.sh       one character -> a Godot web export
#   lossy_sprites.py    512 px lossy pass the 2048 px overlay threshold misses
#   assemble_trio.py    three exports -> one shared-engine route
#   mk_props_keeper.py  CS-props-trio -> trio-minus-the-played-character
#   mk_portraits.py     select-screen portraits, cut from real exported frames
#   verify_trio.js      headless-Chrome proof that it actually plays
#
build-*/
stage-*/
props/
logs/
verify-local/
